{{#is_alert}}
Firewall {{device_ip.name}} has rejected the integration's API credentials, so no metrics are collected from it. Check that the configured API key or user still exists, has not expired, and keeps an admin role with XML API access.
{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_recovery}}
Firewall {{device_ip.name}} accepts the integration's credentials again.
{{/is_recovery}}
